37
00:01:37,530 --> 00:01:39,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our mission this time around
is a rough one.</font>

38
00:01:39,950 --> 00:01:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you do it, Lee?</font>

39
00:01:41,410 --> 00:01:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be okay! I can go anytime.</font>

40
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that's my protege!</font>

41
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:49,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Lee!</font>

42
00:01:50,170 --> 00:01:51,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Guy-sensei!</font>

43
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're off!</font>

44
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those large bags no doubt mean
an overnight expedition mission.</font>

45
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think we'd encounter the ideal pair
so quickly. We're lucky.</font>

46
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:10,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it's settled.</font>

47
00:02:10,270 --> 00:02:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. Starting operation.
To infilrtra... Whoa!</font>

48
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heavy! Get off, you idiot.</font>

49
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To... infiltrate...
the super elite hidden village...</font>

50
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:34,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Village Hidden in Leaves!</font>

51
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:40,680
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Meeting the</font>

52
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:40,680
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Rare Visitors</font>

53
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, we look just like those two!</font>

54
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:54,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naturally. We refined
our Disguise Jutsu for this very day.</font>

55
00:02:55,270 --> 00:02:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're after the classified information
of the Leaf...</font>

56
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

57
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be famous if this goes well!</font>

58
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:05,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The idea is to win distinction
for our village.</font>

59
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we'll get tons of missions
and we'll be the village heroes!</font>

60
00:03:10,370 --> 00:03:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Village Heroes! Mondai and Poccha!</font>

61
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:20,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.
As of this moment, my name's Guy.</font>

62
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Ninja, "Mondai Guy"!</font>

63
00:03:23,050 --> 00:03:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'm the protege, "Poccha Lee"!</font>

64
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:26,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Lee.</font>

65
00:03:26,810 --> 00:03:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Guy-sensei!</font>

66
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing like a large village, sure enough!</font>

67
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, everyone's like a Ninja.</font>

68
00:03:44,870 --> 00:03:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Don't be looking all about so much!</font>

69
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up.</font>

70
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a chief in this village
called the "Hokage."</font>

71
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:56,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No doubt classified information
is concentrated where that person is.</font>

72
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I see.
— If I remember correctly,</font>

73
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that person's in a building easy to spot
with a "Fire" mark on it or something.</font>

74
00:04:07,890 --> 00:04:09,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— There it is!
— That's it!</font>

75
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about Hokage-sama's house?</font>

76
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yikes!
— Yikes!</font>

77
00:04:14,230 --> 00:04:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi.</font>

78
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:20,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing special! We're not after Leaf
classified information or any... Any...</font>

79
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you an idiot?!</font>

80
00:04:22,570 --> 00:04:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nothing at all!</font>

81
00:04:24,570 --> 00:04:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

82
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, we've got to act naturally here.</font>

83
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

84
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi. I'm Guy.</font>

85
00:04:32,290 --> 00:04:33,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Lee.</font>

86
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy and Lee, eh?</font>

87
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:39,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you guys have
a different atmosphere than usual?</font>

88
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. It's your imagination!</font>

89
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:45,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I feel like something's different...</font>

90
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:49,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there's a kite up there flying
while eating a pork cutlet rice bowl!</font>

91
00:04:52,350 --> 00:04:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Where? Where?</font>

92
00:04:55,230 --> 00:04:57,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? There's no kite anywhere.</font>

93
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what?</font>

94
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, that Ninja has to go
and stand behind us</font>

95
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without any sign of his presence.</font>

96
00:05:08,570 --> 00:05:10,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it seems we fooled him good.</font>

97
00:05:11,290 --> 00:05:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our Disguise Jutsu is perfect,
sure enough.</font>

98
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, infiltration is kind of easy,
isn't it?!</font>

99
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf isn't worth fearing!</font>

100
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy and Lee imposters are
prowling around the village?</font>

101
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to think they'd enter the village
in disguises</font>

102
00:05:30,100 --> 00:05:33,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without even using Transformation Jutsu.
Are they really Ninja?</font>

103
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weird people find their way in
when a village grows.</font>

104
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:43,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's nonsense, but I thought
I would at least report it for now.</font>

105
00:05:43,650 --> 00:05:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, we can't just leave
intruders unchecked.</font>

106
00:05:47,950 --> 00:05:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we throw them out?</font>

107
00:05:49,410 --> 00:05:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— No, leave them be.
— What?</font>

108
00:05:52,790 --> 00:05:54,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It sounds interesting, doesn't it?</font>

109
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:58,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're going to the trouble of
calling themselves Ninja of this village.</font>

110
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

111
00:06:00,250 --> 00:06:02,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We probably don't need to worry.</font>

112
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unlikely that anyone could be
fooled by such obvious imposters.</font>

113
00:06:09,010 --> 00:06:13,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, please.
Guy-sensei, Bushy Brow!</font>

114
00:06:13,890 --> 00:06:18,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretty please with sugar on top!
Just the one day today would be fine!</font>

115
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me join your training!</font>

116
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:24,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what's with this guy all of a sudden?</font>

117
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably a real acquaintance
of theirs, but...</font>

118
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:29,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does he think we're going to do training?</font>

119
00:06:31,740 --> 00:06:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do anything!
I've always been interested in Taijutsu.</font>

120
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean... okay?! It's okay, right?</font>

121
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Anyway, let's turn him away.
— Right.</font>

122
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. Take a pass.</font>

123
00:06:43,790 --> 00:06:45,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Why?!</font>

124
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because our training is very harsh,
rough and difficult.</font>

125
00:06:50,890 --> 00:06:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Difficult training, huh?</font>

126
00:06:52,850 --> 00:06:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, I'm getting even more fired up!
Please!</font>

127
00:06:56,430 --> 00:07:01,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't get in your way, no matter what!
Come on.</font>

128
00:07:01,350 --> 00:07:03,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Absolutely not!
— Absolutely not!</font>

129
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, since it's come to this!</font>

130
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:07,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

131
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Real body clones?!</font>

132
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And furthermore...</font>

133
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Harem Jutsu!</font>

134
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

135
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

136
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please.</font>

137
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay!
— Okay!</font>

138
00:07:31,970 --> 00:07:32,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

139
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

140
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— No way.
— No way.</font>

141
00:07:38,470 --> 00:07:40,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother, why'd you say okay?</font>

142
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's done is done,
so, it can't be helped, right?</font>

143
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Guy-sensei, Lee!</font>

144
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the deal, you two?</font>

145
00:07:50,570 --> 00:07:52,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to the farm today, right?</font>

146
00:07:52,990 --> 00:07:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Farm?
— What are you doing,</font>

147
00:07:55,030 --> 00:07:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Letting your mind wander?
The person's waiting. Come on, hurry!</font>

148
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

149
00:08:01,710 --> 00:08:02,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait!</font>

150
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

151
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promised to plant rice
for the sake of training?</font>

152
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only that, all of this...</font>

153
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:14,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's totally huge.</font>

154
00:08:14,470 --> 00:08:17,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gee, thanks. It's a big help,
you guys giving me a hand.</font>

155
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, don't worry about it.</font>

156
00:08:19,770 --> 00:08:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They accepted this
on their own accord, so... Bye.</font>

157
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is this training?</font>

158
00:08:29,570 --> 00:08:30,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it!</font>

159
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:34,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, I will use my body quite a bit
if I do this training.</font>

160
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:37,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I can get in shape
while helping out, huh?</font>

161
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:39,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei, Bushy Brow!</font>

162
00:08:39,830 --> 00:08:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do my best!</font>

163
00:08:42,710 --> 00:08:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's he that motivated?</font>

164
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should we have
to do this manual labor...?</font>

165
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:51,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. Anyway, let's get this over with!</font>

166
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right.</font>

167
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's mean, brother!</font>

168
00:09:01,430 --> 00:09:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, sorry about that.</font>

169
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:06,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

170
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:11,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Poccha?!</font>

171
00:09:14,450 --> 00:09:16,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it,
there are flying leeches</font>

172
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the rice fields, so be careful.</font>

173
00:09:18,990 --> 00:09:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flying leeches?!</font>

174
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Worst-case scenario, it could be deadly.</font>

175
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes.</font>

176
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Poccha!</font>

177
00:09:37,130 --> 00:09:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there!</font>

178
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:51,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what I'd expect of Taijutsu training!</font>

179
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was some intense rice planting!</font>

180
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a good workout!</font>

181
00:09:59,070 --> 00:10:00,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're done...</font>

182
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:02,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was life-or-death...</font>

183
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then shall we move on?</font>

184
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— A manure receptacle?!
— A manure receptacle?!</font>

185
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Spread this in that field over there.</font>

186
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is also training...?</font>

187
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heavy... Smelly...</font>

188
00:10:22,970 --> 00:10:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should I have
to do something like this?</font>

189
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you guys,
why don't you walk straight?</font>

190
00:10:35,070 --> 00:10:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can walk twice
the forward progress distance</font>

191
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you move ahead while
walking left and right like this!</font>

192
00:10:40,450 --> 00:10:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, so that was it?</font>

193
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll also...</font>

194
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:46,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like this?</font>

195
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really hard to balance like this!</font>

196
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

197
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:59,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gee, I didn't realize at all that
there was a method of training like this.</font>

198
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, watch it. Walk more over there...</font>

199
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What'd you say?</font>

200
00:11:29,330 --> 00:11:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What a nightmare.
— Forget about it.</font>

201
00:11:31,330 --> 00:11:33,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, let's lose the kid right now.</font>

202
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for you guys,
you still kind of smell bad.</font>

203
00:11:38,300 --> 00:11:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Shut up!
— Shut up!</font>

204
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There you are, Guy-sensei, Lee.</font>

205
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Sakura.</font>

206
00:11:43,970 --> 00:11:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Naruto. You're here, too?</font>

207
00:11:47,770 --> 00:11:51,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me, I'm training together
with these two today.</font>

208
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:53,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

209
00:11:53,770 --> 00:11:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— More importantly, is something up?
— Yeah...</font>

210
00:11:56,070 --> 00:12:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, I really wanted your help
with something, Guy-sensei, Lee.</font>

211
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— What?</font>

212
00:12:02,110 --> 00:12:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Your laundry blew away?
— Your laundry blew away?</font>

213
00:12:04,570 --> 00:12:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.
It got caught in a bit of a high spot.</font>

214
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:12,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. No way, no way.
We've got lots of work to do, so...</font>

215
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! Here I'm asking precisely
because it's you guys.</font>

216
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:18,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, don't say no!</font>

217
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, if you're in that much trouble,
I could get it for you!</font>

218
00:12:25,890 --> 00:12:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, Guy-sensei?</font>

219
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay?!</font>

220
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure.</font>

221
00:12:38,070 --> 00:12:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a sheer cliff.</font>

222
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:43,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's for sure. We'd be beyond help
if we were to fall from up there.</font>

223
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right?
I don't quite have the confidence...</font>

224
00:12:47,570 --> 00:12:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means...</font>

225
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup! It's right above here.</font>

226
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gee, as one would expect,
I don't think we could...</font>

227
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:09,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that great, Sakura?</font>

228
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For Guy-sensei, a cliff like this is
no different than a flat path.</font>

229
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's encouraging.</font>

230
00:13:15,350 --> 00:13:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a big help having an awesome Ninja
like you close by, Guy-sensei.</font>

231
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

232
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:25,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, please.</font>

233
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother...</font>

234
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. Why is this happening?!</font>

235
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to die.</font>

236
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

237
00:13:38,710 --> 00:13:42,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, as for you guys,
why aren't you using the Chakra suction?</font>

238
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is training for building up
muscular strength!</font>

239
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's what it was?</font>

240
00:13:48,470 --> 00:13:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what I'd expect of a Taijutsu user.</font>

241
00:13:50,470 --> 00:13:54,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never came up with deliberately
draining physical strength!</font>

242
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really do learn a lot from
being with you, Sensei.</font>

243
00:13:58,020 --> 00:13:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This jerk...</font>

244
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... I'm going to die...</font>

245
00:14:02,650 --> 00:14:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

246
00:14:04,490 --> 00:14:06,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close...!</font>

247
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:11,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gee, sorry about that.</font>

248
00:14:11,830 --> 00:14:13,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This jerk...</font>

249
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, we made it.</font>

250
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't look down!</font>

251
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, if we can just take
this back with us...</font>

252
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

253
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I got it.</font>

254
00:14:35,930 --> 00:14:38,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't come loose...
Hey, help me out here.</font>

255
00:14:38,890 --> 00:14:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

256
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...!</font>

257
00:14:52,490 --> 00:14:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, use suction with your Chakra!</font>

258
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is nothing to me!</font>

259
00:14:58,870 --> 00:14:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look out!</font>

260
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:04,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For real? What?!</font>

261
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei! Bushy Brow!</font>

262
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had it...</font>

263
00:15:17,810 --> 00:15:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, Bushy Brow!</font>

264
00:15:20,850 --> 00:15:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was awesome!</font>

265
00:15:23,190 --> 00:15:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To do something like not
using Chakra suction. Awesome!</font>

266
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:28,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Look you...!
— Look you...!</font>

267
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:30,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perfect timing, you guys.</font>

268
00:15:31,530 --> 00:15:32,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade.</font>

269
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:36,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, I've got something
I want to ask you guys to do.</font>

270
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:39,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My companion suddenly started
not feeling well, you see.</font>

271
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yikes, it's huge!
— It's huge!</font>

272
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:46,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems she's caught a cold.</font>

273
00:15:46,250 --> 00:15:51,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a huge slug. Oh, as for this,
is it something like Chief Toad?</font>

274
00:15:51,470 --> 00:15:52,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that sounds about right.</font>

275
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, as you can see,
we can't carelessly move her.</font>

276
00:15:58,350 --> 00:16:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, could you guys look
after her for a while?</font>

277
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm very sorry.</font>

278
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:14,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, what a ridiculous guy.</font>

279
00:16:14,620 --> 00:16:18,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother, at this rate we won't be able
to look for the confidential information.</font>

280
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:19,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right.</font>

281
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up.</font>

282
00:16:22,370 --> 00:16:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you moaning about?</font>

283
00:16:32,590 --> 00:16:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys.</font>

284
00:16:34,090 --> 00:16:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be that you guys can't listen</font>

285
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the words of me,
the Hokage, could it?</font>

286
00:16:38,470 --> 00:16:40,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This is the Hokage?
— This is the Hokage?</font>

287
00:16:43,140 --> 00:16:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad. To think the Hokage
was that fierce a person.</font>

288
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:50,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're taking care of
her precious companion.</font>

289
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We might be able to get into
the Hokage estate surprisingly easily.</font>

290
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:55,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder.</font>

291
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, even Summoning animals
get sick, too...</font>

292
00:16:58,740 --> 00:17:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems to be a light cold.</font>

293
00:17:01,290 --> 00:17:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My nose itches, I have a sore throat,
and I feel weak or something...</font>

294
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, I'm going to chill your forehead!</font>

295
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you so much.</font>

296
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:16,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, here we go.</font>

297
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:20,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no. The itching...</font>

298
00:17:27,270 --> 00:17:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

299
00:17:32,570 --> 00:17:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wha...?!
— What?!</font>

300
00:17:41,410 --> 00:17:43,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's... It's melting...</font>

301
00:17:43,370 --> 00:17:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch it, you!</font>

302
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm very sorry. I'll be more caref...</font>

303
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei! Bushy Brow!
You'll be in danger</font>

304
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you don't move away from there!</font>

305
00:18:02,100 --> 00:18:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My... My lower back...</font>

306
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

307
00:18:05,350 --> 00:18:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm developing my dynamic vision
for narrowly evading danger!</font>

308
00:18:09,810 --> 00:18:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

309
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:13,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Sensei, he was training,
putting his life at risk</font>

310
00:18:13,530 --> 00:18:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even at times like this...?</font>

311
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:20,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though that Bushy Brow guy's
training properly, as for me...!</font>

312
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:27,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've woken up,
Guy-sensei, I'll train with you!</font>

313
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do this!</font>

314
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, the joints in my body hurt...
I feel like I'm going to fall apart...</font>

315
00:18:40,470 --> 00:18:44,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Aren't you a slug?
What are you doing talking about joints?!</font>

316
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Save us.
— Save us!</font>

317
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:59,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had it.
What's going on with this village...?</font>

318
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:02,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll die if I stay in a place like this
any longer.</font>

319
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:05,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Withdraw...</font>

320
00:19:05,990 --> 00:19:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

321
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you guys?</font>

322
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:20,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you dressed
like my protege Lee...?</font>

323
00:19:21,050 --> 00:19:23,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Since it's come to this,
I don't give a damn anymore!</font>

324
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Super Excellent Great Hyper Attack!
— Super Excellent Great Hyper Attack!</font>

325
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really get it,
but it seems we just have to fight, huh?</font>

326
00:19:33,900 --> 00:19:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems.</font>

327
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Lee!</font>

328
00:19:36,570 --> 00:19:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, knockout technique!</font>

329
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Double Dynamic Entry!
— Double Dynamic Entry!</font>

330
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!
What did we go there for in the end?!</font>

331
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really hate, I really hate...</font>

332
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:51,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The likes of the Leaf!
— The likes of the Leaf!</font>

333
00:19:53,500 --> 00:19:55,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tamaya!</font>

334
00:19:59,460 --> 00:20:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord knows where they came from,</font>

335
00:20:01,970 --> 00:20:04,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but now they'll probably never
want to try that again.</font>

336
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure looked like
you were having fun, Tsunade-sama,</font>

337
00:20:06,970 --> 00:20:08,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">going so far as to summon Katsuyu.</font>

338
00:20:08,770 --> 00:20:12,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, my adorable Genin
helped out as well, so...</font>

339
00:20:14,900 --> 00:20:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, we've had our breather.
So, please, be getting back to work.</font>

340
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yes, ma'am.</font>

341
00:20:20,690 --> 00:20:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But still... What was with that Naruto?</font>

342
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:27,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he seriously believed
those two were for real.</font>

343
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that all about?</font>

344
00:20:29,540 --> 00:20:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows...?</font>

345
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

346
00:20:31,910 --> 00:20:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

347
00:20:32,870 --> 00:20:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Someone who looked just like me now...
— Man, you guys got separated.</font>

348
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't know what to do.</font>

349
00:20:38,670 --> 00:20:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me, I was impressed!</font>

350
00:20:40,760 --> 00:20:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys were really cool earlier!</font>

351
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've learned of the intricacies
of Taijutsu or something...</font>

352
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A lot happened,
but I'll continue training right away!</font>

353
00:20:52,100 --> 00:20:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Continue training?</font>

354
00:20:53,850 --> 00:20:57,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, come on,
let's continue the Taijutsu training!</font>

355
00:21:00,030 --> 00:21:04,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moron, moron, moron.</font>

356
00:21:19,650 --> 00:21:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

357
00:21:19,650 --> 00:21:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

358
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

359
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

360
00:21:42,900 --> 00:21:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

361
00:21:42,900 --> 00:21:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

362
00:21:53,690 --> 00:22:06,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

363
00:21:53,690 --> 00:22:06,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

364
00:22:06,030 --> 00:22:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

365
00:22:06,030 --> 00:22:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

366
00:22:17,550 --> 00:22:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

367
00:22:17,550 --> 00:22:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

368
00:22:29,150 --> 00:22:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

369
00:22:29,150 --> 00:22:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

370
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:44,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! Why should a Ninja have
to do something like get rid of a ghost?!</font>

371
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">We have no choice, right?
After all, a commission is a commission!</font>

372
00:22:47,130 --> 00:22:51,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The ghost of a feudal lord, my butt?!
Th-That's ridiculous!</font>

373
00:22:51,140 --> 00:22:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But they say it comes out at night!</font>

374
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">A ghost warrior clad in a white armor!</font>

375
00:22:55,890 --> 00:22:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">N-No, I'm not afraid of it at all!</font>

376
00:22:58,100 --> 00:22:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">H-Hey! Behind you!</font>

377
00:22:59,730 --> 00:23:00,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">No!</font>

378
00:23:00,980 --> 00:23:03,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I knew it! You ARE afraid!</font>

379
00:23:03,520 --> 00:23:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"A White Cursed Samurai."</font>

